WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.250
Let's export your Google contacts, so you can review the people you already know.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.042
On a computer, open Google Contacts and sign in to your own account.

3
00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:16.542
Select a contact. To export everyone, choose Selection actions, then All.

4
00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:21.083
Open More actions, choose Export, and select Google CSV.

5
00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:26.208
Choose Export, and keep the downloaded CSV somewhere you can find it.

6
00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:33.083
In Gold Mine Genie, choose your file in Import Studio. Review the matches before adding people.
